OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry to start the evening. Cloud and
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain spread north into
OL,8,FOrkney before midnight, continuing
OL,9,Fnorth to affect Shetland overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FCloudy with some outbreaks
OL,12,Fof rain at first, this clearing
OL,13,Fthrough the morning. Then bright or
OL,14,Fsunny spells and a few showers,
OL,15,Fbecoming dry in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
